%% Claude Code agent operating workflow
flowchart TD
  A[Read README + 00-start-here] --> B[git status]
  B --> C[Create branch type/desc]
  C --> D[Verify live via MCP - read only]
  D --> E{Change writes to prod?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Get explicit approval]
  E -->|No| G[Make change on branch]
  F --> G
  G --> H[Secret scan + validation]
  H --> I[Update docs + .env.example + CHANGELOG]
  I --> J[Final diff summary]
  J --> K{Told to push?}
  K -->|No| L[Stop - do not push]
  K -->|Yes| M[Push]
